      358.92
    ],
    "text": "LAND ACQUISITION ACT (Chapter 460) Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      19.91800880432129
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      359.13,
      286.43,
      446.48
    ],
    "text": "My No. : Ds/KGK/4/9/94/143/LA. Land Ministry Reference No. 4/3/15/2011/VE/204. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      447.67,
      286.44,
      581.6
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: An allotment of Mobrey Estate bearing an extent of about 0.3248 Hectare within the total extent shown in the plan No. P.P. Maha 6427 and dated 09.06.2015 prepared by senior Superintendent of surveys (Kandy District) situated in the village of Mobrey Estate in the Grama Niladari Division No. 267, Hindagala in the Minor Division of Gangawata Korale in the Divisional Secretarys Division of Kandy and Gangawata Korale in Kandy District Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      583.52,
      286.46,
      646.92
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1\u2014Name of the Land: Mobrey Estate; Original Claimant: Mobrey Hotel Company, Level 6, Hemas House, No. 75, Braybrook Place, Colombo 02, Extent 0.3248 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.39,
      527.6
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3143; East: Lot No. 01 in P. P. Maha 3143; South: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3143, ela (C) and Mobrey estate claimed by Government; West: ela (Canal), Mobrey Estate claimed by Government and Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3143. All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Kandy and Gangawata Korale on 17th day of September 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 10th day of September 2015, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      47.995201110839844
    ]
  },
